  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 503.03 Department Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 503.03 Department Review.\n\n(a) The owner shall submit the inundation map(s) to the department for review and approval prior to incorporating it into the EAP.\n\n(b) The department shall inform the owner in writing within 30 days of receipt whether the inundation map is approved or of any inadequacies requiring revision and resubmission.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
